sequenceDiagram
    participant FS as Local Filesystem
    participant C as Client Daemon
    participant S as Server
    participant DB as Turso DB
    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2

    Note over FS,C: File changed locally
    FS->>C: fsnotify event
    C->>C: Insert pending_operation (status: pending)

    Note over C,S: Sync initiated
    C->>S: gRPC: SyncManifest
    S->>DB: Query file versions

    alt New file or modified file
        S->>R2: Store chunks
        S->>DB: Insert/update version
        S-->>C: Sync plan (what to download)
    end

    C->>C: Download missing chunks
    C->>C: Mark pending_operation (status: completed)
    C->>C: local_files.state: pending_modify → synced
